Interface is a smart companion that helps you explore the Infinite Garden of Ethereum in a simple and intuitive way.

Powers it gives you:

• Follow – any wallet to see their onchain activity in an intuitive feed. We support hundreds of different protocols, assets, and transaction types;
• Discover – new opportunities and content, including new mints, fresh airdrops, governance proposals, and even on-chain messages;
• Connect – with the people you've met during your onchain journey by importing your existing social graphs from Farcaster or Lens;
• Find – your fellow community members based on the common NFTs you own or POAP events you have attended;
• Browse – any wallet's activity, tokens, NFTs, POAPs, Safes, along with other assets;
• Search – for projects, NFT collections, tokens, wallets or ENS domains;
• Learn – what people are doing onchain through a curated readable feed;
• Travel – to other decentralised applications through our profile view that is infused with various social identities like Farcaster
• Always stay updated – with customisable live notifications.

There are lots of things happening onchain. Often it can be hard and overwhelming to find what or who you are looking for, but we are here to help! We hope you enjoy the journey into the future!
